          "_name": "content9",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"mbr-section article content9\" group=\"Article\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Text Width\" name=\"innerWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Line Width\" name=\"lineLength\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Line Color\" name=\"lineColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"inner-container\" mbr-style=\"{'width': innerWidth + '%'}\">\n            <hr class=\"line\" mbr-style=\"{'width': lineLength + '%'}\">\n            <div class=\"section-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".section-text\" mbr-text>Committee (2026):<div>President: Peter Jones</div><div>Chairperson: Jim Hibbert</div><div>Treasurer: Malcolm Dee</div><div>Member: Lucy Bruzzone</div><div>Member: Lotti Kuhn</div><div>Member: Jenny Martin</div><br><div><a href=\"assets/files/Camsail-ChairmansReport2024_5.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\"><i><b>Chairperson's Report</b></i></a> for the 2024/5 season</div><br><div><a href=\"assets/files/Camsail-accounts2024_5.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\"><i><b>Treasurer's Report</b></i></a> for the 2024/5 season</div><div><br>Camsail has a&nbsp;<a href=\"assets/files/Camsail-Constitution_adopted2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\"><b><i>constitution</i></b></a>, which was adopted on 12 December 2018.</div><br><div>Camsail has a <a href=\"assets/files/DATA-PRIVACYPOLICYv4.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Data Privacy Policy</i></b></a>, which you can view here.</div><br><div>We are very grateful to Imray for a scheme whereby Camsail members can obtain discounts (10% on Admiralty publications, up to 25% on others) when ordering publications from Imray on-line by clicking&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.imray.com/itugv2/?id=19ca14e7ea6328a42e0eb13d585e4c22\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br><br></div></div>\n            <hr class=\"line\" mbr-style=\"{'width': lineLength + '%'}\">\n        </div>\n        </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content9-1i",
          "_isUserblock": true,
